            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amigurumi-increase"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "increase"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at the tip, then work the straight sides, then "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amigurumi-decrease"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "decrease"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " back to the base. Stuff lightly before closing. The leaf should be gently curved rather than fully round."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: Chain 14. Working along chain: 2 sc in 2nd ch from hook, sc in next 11 ch, 3 sc in last ch, rotate. Along opposite side: sc in next 11 ch, 2 sc in last ch (30 st)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2: Increase 6 stitches evenly around (36 st)"
          }
